<title>POLAND: HUTA FERRUM DOWN 9.1 PCT ON BOURSE DEBUT.</title>
<headline>HUTA FERRUM DOWN 9.1 PCT ON BOURSE DEBUT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish metal pipe maker Huta Ferrum SA started trading on the main market of the Warsaw Stock Exchange at 10 zlotys, 9.1 percent below its public offering price of 11 zlotys.</p>
<p>Ferrum's first-quarter initial public offering of three million shares had been oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
